---
// apps/docs/src/components/FeatureGrid.astro
---

<section class="my-20 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      Built for Modern Web Standards
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
      Zero heavy dependencies. Browser-safe, deterministic, and built from the ground up for developer and AI workflows.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1 -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal-card p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mb-4 font-bold text-lg">
        ⚡
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
        Zero Heavy Dependencies
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Pure TypeScript with no heavy math engines or bundles. Shaders run directly on standard WebGL2 contexts in any browser.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2 -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal-card p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-4 font-bold text-lg">
        🤖
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
        Agent-Native Architecture
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Every parameter and editing action is exposed as Model Context Protocol (MCP) compatible tools. Autonomous AI coding agents can direct, edit, and validate scenes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3 -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal-card p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-100 dark:bg-pink-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400 mb-4 font-bold text-lg">
        🎬
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
        Interchange & Directing
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Multi-shot scenes with camera moves, 3D tilt, and motion blur. Export seamlessly to Lottie, Apple Motion, FCP7 XML, and CMX 3600 EDL.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
